"text","text":"’s set of hyperedges. An isolated vertex becomes an empty hyperedge, and an empty"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hyperedge an isolated vertex, so the dual is always defined; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dual().dual()"},{"type":"text","text":" is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hypergraph with its vertices relabeled to their indices and its positions kept."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/hypergraph\/dual()","title":"dual()"}}}